                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "The JHCC will be a forum for addressing and resolving issues involved in the implementation and ongoing monitoring and evaluation of the managed cared programs of the Medical Expense Plan for Occupational Employees. To accomplish these objectives the JHCC will:",
            "block_bbox": [
